<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tg">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Ҳисоби маблағҳо 3</title>

<style>
* {box-sizing:border-box}

body {
  margin:0;
  padding:15px;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#1e293b;
}

header {
  background:#166534;
  color:white;
  padding:22px;
  text-align:center;
  border-radius:15px;
  margin-bottom:15px;
}

.box {
  background:white;
  padding:17px;
  border-radius:14px;
  margin-bottom:15px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 8px #00000010;
}

h3 {color:#166534}

input,select,button {
  width:100%;
  padding:13px;
  margin:6px 0;
  border-radius:8px;
  border:1px solid #ddd;
  font-size:16px;
}

button {
  background:#15803d;
  color:white;
  border:0;
  cursor:pointer;
}

.danger {background:#dc2626}
.blue {background:#2563eb}
.gray {background:#64748b}

.balance {
  text-align:center;
  font-size:30px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#15803d;
}

.stats {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:10px;
}

.stat {
  background:#f0fdf4;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:10px;
  text-align:center;
}

.stat strong {
  display:block;
  font-size:20px;
  margin-top:8px;
}

.item {
  border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
  padding:12px 0;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}

.small {
  color:#64748b;
  font-size:13px;
}

.member {
  background:#f8fafc;
  padding:12px;
  margin:7px 0;
  border-radius:8px;
}

footer {
  text-align:center;
  color:#64748b;
  padding:15px;
  font-size:13px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h2>ҲИСОБИ МАБЛАҒҲО 3</h2>
<p>Системаи ҳисоби маблағи ҳамсинфон</p>
</header>

<div class="box">
<h3>💰 Бақияи умумӣ</h3>
<div class="balance" id="balance">0 сомонӣ</div